<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Static sitemap for the marketing site's top-level pages.

  This intentionally does NOT enumerate individual blog posts
  (/blog/$slug) or project case studies (/projects/$slug) -- those are
  rows in Supabase, not files, and a static file can't stay in sync with
  them. Generating those entries needs a small server route that queries
  published blog_posts / projects and returns XML, which needs TanStack
  Start's server-route API (this project is on a very recent
  @tanstack/react-start release where that API was still settling at the
  time this was written -- check the current docs for
  `createServerFileRoute` or equivalent before wiring it up). Until then,
  search engines can still discover those pages by crawling the links on
  /blog and /projects.
-->
